            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo, abena Levi bena ubapeele umulimo wakusunga Itenti lya cipangano, kumo kwine ne fibombelo ne fipe fyonse ifyabamo. Bali nokulalisenda pamo ne fibombelo fyaliko no kulalisunga, kabili bakalacita ne nkambi shabo ukushinguluka Itenti lyakwa Lesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo lyonse mwasesha inkambi, abena Levi ebakalapangulula Itenti lyakwa Lesa, kabili ebakalalimika ilyo mwaya cita inkambi kumbi. Uyo onse uushili mwina Levi uwapalamina kwi Tenti lyakwa Lesa wena akepaiwefye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abena Israeli bakemike amatenti yabo mu mpuka mu mpuka, no muntu onse ali nokuba mwibumba lya mpuka ya luko lwakwe, apali uluunga lwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo abena Levi bena bali nokwimika amatenti yabo ukushinguluka Itenti lya cipangano, pakuti balelicingilila kabili pakuti ubukali tabuponene pa lukuta lwa bena Israeli. Abena Levi ebali no mulimo wakusunga Itenti lya cipangano pa bena Israeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi abena Israeli bacitile fyonse ngefyo Yawe akonkomeshe Mose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.54"
            ]
